      "content": "It sounds like you are going through a profoundly difficult period of creative and emotional exhaustion right now. Please know that these feelings of emptiness and burnout are overwhelming, but they are not permanent. Reaching out is a massive first step, and I strongly encourage you to speak with a therapist or counselor who can offer professional support during this tough time. Remember that periods of creative drought are often followed by unexpected shifts, so please be gentle with yourself.",
